{"title":"2012 CEMC Galois Problems/Problem 1","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_1\"><a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Problem 1</a></span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_CEMC_Galois_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Adam and Budan are playing a game of Bocce. Each wants their ball to land closest to the jack ball. The positions of Adam’s ball, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/1/9/019e9892786e493964e145e7c5cf7b700314e53b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"15\" height=\"14\" />, Budan's ball, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/f/5/ff5fb3d775862e2123b007eb4373ff6cc1a34d4e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$B$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"17\" height=\"14\" />, and the jack ball, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/b/b/abb5588023cfa1ac14643e9778699f03eecc57a3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$J$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" /> are shown in the diagram.\n</p>\n<hr />\n<p><i>An image is supposed to go here.  You can help us out by creating one and <span class=\"plainlinks\"><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/index.php?title=2012_CEMC_Galois_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit\">editing it in</a></span>.  Thanks.</i>\n</p>\n<hr />\n<p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Parts\">Parts</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_CEMC_Galois_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Parts\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_CEMC_Galois_Problems/Problem_1a\" title=\"2012 CEMC Galois Problems/Problem 1a\">2012 CEMC Galois Problems/Problem 1a</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_CEMC_Galois_Problems/Problem_1b\" title=\"2012 CEMC Galois Problems/Problem 1b\">2012 CEMC Galois Problems/Problem 1b</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_CEMC_Galois_Problems/Problem_1c\" title=\"2012 CEMC Galois Problems/Problem 1c\">2012 CEMC Galois Problems/Problem 1c</a></li></ul>\n\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017230528\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.010 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.015 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 34/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 410/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 4/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 513/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    5.556      1 Template:Image_needed\n100.00%    5.556      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:35637:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261017230528 and revision id 278088. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}